# Input

```scss
@mixin frames {
@if true {0%{opacity:0}} @else {25%{opacity:0.25}}
@for $i from 1 through 2 {#{$i * 50%} {opacity:$i * 0.5}}
@each $i in 25,75 {#{$i}% {opacity:0.5}}
$i: 0; @while $i < 1 {50%{opacity:0.5} $i:$i + 1;}
0%, 50%, to {opacity:0.5}
from, 75% {opacity:0.75}
#{$i}%, 100% {opacity:1}
}
.after {color:red}

```


# Formatted

```scss
@mixin frames {
	@if true {
		0% {
			opacity: 0;
		}
	} @else {
		25% {
			opacity: 0.25;
		}
	}
	@for $i from 1 through 2 {
		#{$i * 50%} {
			opacity: $i * 0.5;
		}
	}
	@each $i in 25, 75 {
		#{$i}% {
			opacity: 0.5;
		}
	}
	$i: 0;
	@while $i < 1 {
		50% {
			opacity: 0.5;
		}
		$i: $i + 1;
	}
	0%,
	50%,
	to {
		opacity: 0.5;
	}
	from,
	75% {
		opacity: 0.75;
	}
	#{$i}%,
	100% {
		opacity: 1;
	}
}
.after {
	color: red;
}

```
